interface.longDescription:
Mempipe keeps your documents as files you own: PDFs, Markdown notes and CSV files, organised into Spaces.

With Mempipe in ChatGPT you can:
- search your documents for a word or phrase;
- read PDFs and notes as clean, structured text;
- get answers that link to the exact passage they came from, so you can check them;
- run SQL over your CSV files;
- add a file you attach in the chat, save notes, and delete files you no longer need.

Open Mempipe to browse your Spaces, read a document beside the chat, and choose which files ChatGPT uses as context.

Mempipe changes your files only if you allow write access when you connect. You need a Mempipe account.
